<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The feeling of lying sprawled on the ground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cold hands and feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could tell drool was hanging loose from my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I opened my eyes...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田山回転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\目を明ける.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "111" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
The scenery was turned exactly 90 degrees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Am I lying face down?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's going on right now...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I took in the scenery in front of my eyes, the next thing I took in was the pain all over my body.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ow-ow-ow..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Bearing the pain all over, I sat up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田山回転後.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It hurt, but it didn't seem like I had any broken bones or sprains.<PG>
Where is this...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the mountains...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What time is it...?<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田山回転後.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A pain like being hit over the head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is this pain?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It felt less like I'd hit my head and more like it hurt from inside my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was happening just before this...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, got a minute?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"About the thirteenth-year memorial service, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others say they won't be attending." [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? How come?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... something came up. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> are going to attend in their place, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　No, I get </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> coming, but why </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s got nothing to do with the thirteenth-year memorial service, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I think it's okay to tell you this. Today, while I was planning the thirteenth-year memorial service with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others, I ran into </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't tell me... her danger sense...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Exactly. That's why I can't let </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others attend."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm. Well, if we do what </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says, there's probably nothing to worry about."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田山回転後.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That's the last thing I remember.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means it's late March right now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took out my phone and checked the time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Shiyo 800, April 8... 12:30 a.m., it says...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is wrong. That exchange with <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> I just remembered is my last memory.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is it suddenly April 8?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is my phone broken...?<PG>
No, I knew the feel of this place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These were the Arata mountains.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the air and the atmosphere, it was obvious this wasn't Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means―<PG>
Don't tell me I've got...
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
amnesia...?<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
You're kidding!? I've lost my memories of the last half month or so!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hurriedly checked the messages and photos on my phone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The newest message was from <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>: 'Don't eat lunch before you go to Arata.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was also a video, apparently sent to <STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE>, of <STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE> in twin tails.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was packed with things I had no memory of.<PG>
No, wait, what even is this phone?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know this thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouldn't know it, and yet my fingertips knew how to work it and found what I wanted to see right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I must have handled this phone plenty of times before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means I've just plain forgotten.<PG>
I went back through the phone in all kinds of ways, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
other than the fact that I was in the Arata mountains, there was nothing in particular that told me what was going on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I should try calling someone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No signal, huh... Can't be helped. I'll move to somewhere I can get reception.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田山回転後.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
My whole body still hurt, but not so much that I couldn't take it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I slowly stood up and stretched.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田斜面.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Apparently I'd tumbled down the steep slope in front of me and blacked out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, I guess I'll try climbing this slope.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "裏ルート用\stick-oharai1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But once I actually started climbing, there was nothing but moonlight to see by, and tree roots and tall grass stuck out everywhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Talk about hard to climb.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\獣道.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Even so, I somehow made it up the slope, about 10 meters, and reached flat ground.<PG>
This is more of an animal trail than a mountain path.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I fell from here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But why was I walking in a place like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Judging from the situation, I was probably walking alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'd been with someone, they would've gotten me out.<PG>
Or maybe someone went to get people to rescue me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, I can't just carelessly move from here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is definitely Arata, but I can't tell where in Arata...<PG>
I sat down on a nearby tree root and tried once more to think back on what had happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Walking around a place like this... maybe we were doing a test of courage <STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE> set up?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's the kind of thing <STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE> would come up with...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
A test of courage...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\紙人形6枚.gal" "NORMAL" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\獣道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It came back to me, faintly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were taking turns telling ghost stories at the Niimura main house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A test of courage after ghost stories is the standard move, but...<PG>
This late at night, me aside, they wouldn't have <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE> walking around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, with <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE> along, maybe it'd work out...?<PG>
I can't remember anything besides the ghost stories... 
{PAUSE ""}
Can't be helped. Worst case, I should wait here until dawn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I walk around alone, I'll just get more lost.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "7000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Footsteps...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Has help come!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is someone there!? Hey!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouted toward the footsteps.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who is this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl in a red kimono, with long hair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A little younger than me, maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And only one of her eyes was green.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means she's from Arata after all?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\降臨\降臨.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Are you all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even in an emergency like this, when a stranger talks to me, I don't know how to answer.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"You're </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, aren't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I'm glad you don't seem badly hurt."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh, yeah... </STYLE>
